nest brutally honest  nice words with no action  hurt when they are uttered by those with  power  a red card for greenpeace next a protest  sends soccer fans  to hospital  soccer players at a euro 2020 match got  a surprise when an activist literally  dropped in  a parachute from greenpeace disrupted  the match between france and germany he  claims he intended to fly  over the stadium but lost control he  almost hit some  fans he ended up landing on the field  debri fell on the field in the main  grandstand just missing the french  manager  two people were injured and the  government says police could have shot  the activists down  greenpeace has apologized for the stunt  and one of soccer's biggest stars might  have cost coca-cola billions of dollars  because of his healthy  choices  [Music]  so much for branding cristiano ronaldo  urged people to drink water  at the european championship after  pushing aside those two coke bottles  right after his advice the beverage  titan stock plummeted wiping out 4  billion  in market value coca-cola is a sponsor  of euro 2020 and in a statement it said  everyone is entitled to their drink  preferences  and that is global national for this  wednesday i'm donna friesen tonight's  your canada is this close-up shot of a  hummingbird coming in for a landing in  vale mount bc thanks for watching hope  to see you here again tomorrow  take care of yourselves bye-bye
 

